The archive codec in egs_reader.py adapts the public archive format, key
expansion, and compression logic from AntonioDePau/KHPCPatchManager:
https://github.com/AntonioDePau/KHPCPatchManager
Upstream files: OpenKH/egsEncryption.cs, OpenKH/egsHDAsset.cs, OpenKH/hed.cs.
The upstream project credits Noxalus, Xeeynamo, and the OpenKH team.
Its Apache-2.0 license is included as LICENSE.

The Python PKG writer replaces selected remastered SCD payloads and retains
all other archive entries and empty HED rows. No upstream executable is
included in this version.

German voices are provided by Rikux3's kh1fm-undub-ger-pc project:
https://github.com/Rikux3/kh1fm-undub-ger-pc
The audio files themselves are not included in this build package.
No license for game/audio assets is granted by this package's code license.

Technical reference: Fotia13's French Voices Patch, whose author documents
native Switch 1 PKG/HED patching and the KH1 Program 1 destination:
https://www.nexusmods.com/kingdomheartsfinalmix/mods/123
